    +----------------------------------------------------------------------+
    |                                                                      |
    |  sk64 - keys                                                         |
    |                                                                      |
    |  keys                                                                |
    |    enter       edit the value in $EDITOR                             |
    |    e           edit every key as one YAML document                   |
    |    N           add a key                                             |
    |    D           delete the key                                        |
    |    i           import a file as the key's value                      |
    |    x           export the raw bytes to a file                        |
    |    r           consumers of this resource                            |
    |    v           toggle value search for this resource                 |
    |    ctrl+z      revert the last save to this resource                 |
    |                                                                      |
    |  global                                                              |
    |    ?           this help                                             |
    |    esc         back / close / cancel the in-flight request           |
    |    h/j/k/l     same as the arrow keys                                |
    |    /           filter the current list                               |
    |    ctrl+f      search resource and key names cluster-wide            |
    |    ctrl+r      refresh the current screen                            |
    |    ctrl+k      switch kube context                                   |
    |    ctrl+p      switch project                                        |
    |    ctrl+z      undo the last save (key list)                         |
    |    L           link the item under the cursor to a project           |
    |    Q / ctrl+c  quit (ctrl+c always requires two quick presses)       |
    |                                                                      |
    |  notes                                                               |
    |    session undo (ctrl+z) is in RAM only - it dies with sk64          |
    |    value search (v) checks this resource, never the cluster          |
    |    destructive confirms need uppercase Y; esc always cancels         |
    |                                                                      |
    +----------------------------------------------------------------------+



